WEBVTT

1
00:01:03,396 --> 00:01:05,356
Ya Tuhan, selamatkan kami!

2
00:01:05,440 --> 00:01:07,067
Apa ini?

3
00:01:07,609 --> 00:01:09,903
Menyeramkan sekali!

4
00:01:13,656 --> 00:01:15,950
Dia datang!

5
00:01:16,034 --> 00:01:17,035
Suster Clara?

6
00:01:19,079 --> 00:01:20,121
Suster Clara?

7
00:01:24,459 --> 00:01:25,835
Apa yang terjadi?

8
00:01:28,713 --> 00:01:32,091
Jangan biarkan iblis menguasaimu!

9
00:03:14,819 --> 00:03:19,240
<i>Matius 26:41.</i>

10
00:03:19,324 --> 00:03:20,825
<i>Berjaga-jaga dan berdoalah</i>

11
00:03:20,909 --> 00:03:23,578
<i>agar kau tidak jatuh ke dalam pencobaan.</i>

12
00:03:27,790 --> 00:03:29,876
<i>Jiwa memang mau,</i>

13
00:03:29,959 --> 00:03:32,962
<i>tapi manusia itu lemah.</i>

14
00:03:33,046 --> 00:03:38,551
<i>Hanya doa senjata kita</i>
<i>melawan kekuatan gelap.</i>

15
00:03:43,514 --> 00:03:46,142
<i>Saat kau lemah,</i>

16
00:03:46,768 --> 00:03:48,895
<i>iblis akan datang</i>

17
00:03:48,978 --> 00:03:51,356
<i>dan menggodamu.</i>

18
00:04:04,202 --> 00:04:05,954
<i>Doa,</i>

19
00:04:06,037 --> 00:04:07,830
<i>penitensi,</i>

20
00:04:07,914 --> 00:04:09,457
<i>dan pengorbanan.</i>

21
00:04:09,540 --> 00:04:11,251
<i>Itulah senjatamu.</i>

22
00:04:12,126 --> 00:04:14,170
<i>Lawanlah dosa,</i>

23
00:04:14,254 --> 00:04:16,464
<i>kelemahan manusia,</i>

24
00:04:16,547 --> 00:04:17,966
<i>dan tujuh dosa besar,</i>

25
00:04:18,925 --> 00:04:19,801
<i>kesombongan,</i>

26
00:04:19,884 --> 00:04:21,302
<i>iri hati,</i>

27
00:04:21,386 --> 00:04:22,679
<i>kerakusan,</i>

28
00:04:22,762 --> 00:04:24,389
<i>kemalasan,</i>

29
00:04:24,472 --> 00:04:26,015
<i>hawa nafsu,</i>

30
00:04:26,099 --> 00:04:27,058
<i>kemarahan,</i>

31
00:04:27,141 --> 00:04:28,810
<i>dan keserakahan.</i>

32
00:04:30,186 --> 00:04:32,313
<i>Sucikan jiwamu.</i>

33
00:04:32,981 --> 00:04:34,857
<i>Jika tidak,</i>

34
00:04:35,483 --> 00:04:38,361
<i>kegelapan akan menguasaimu.</i>

35
00:04:53,751 --> 00:04:55,336
Suster Rosa?

36
00:05:04,387 --> 00:05:06,514
Maaf, Suster Piedad.

37
00:05:10,601 --> 00:05:13,438
Apa ini? Dari mana kau dapat ini?

38
00:05:15,898 --> 00:05:19,110
Para pekerja membawanya dari dermaga.

39
00:05:19,193 --> 00:05:20,737
Mungkin

40
00:05:20,820 --> 00:05:24,532
itu sumbangan untuk biara
dari kapal yang karam itu.

41
00:05:26,576 --> 00:05:28,077
Donasi?

42
00:05:30,288 --> 00:05:33,916
Atau mungkin sampah dari Meksiko?

43
00:05:41,049 --> 00:05:42,467
Suster Rosa?

44
00:05:58,900 --> 00:06:02,820
<i>Kemarilah. Buka ini.</i>

45
00:06:24,842 --> 00:06:27,303
Iblis telah datang!

46
00:06:27,386 --> 00:06:29,180
Dengarkan aku!

47
00:06:29,263 --> 00:06:31,307
Dia di sini!

48
00:06:31,390 --> 00:06:33,935
Lepaskan aku!

49
00:06:34,894 --> 00:06:36,938
Iblis telah datang!

50
00:06:37,021 --> 00:06:40,733
Dia di sini! Iblis telah datang!

51
00:07:01,671 --> 00:07:04,507
Aku Ana. Siapa namamu?

52
00:07:04,590 --> 00:07:05,883
Flor.

53
00:07:15,351 --> 00:07:17,228
Kau mencari siapa?

54
00:07:17,979 --> 00:07:19,188
Kakakku, Clara.

55
00:07:19,272 --> 00:07:22,150
Kau punya kakak di biara?

56
00:07:22,233 --> 00:07:23,860
Kalian beruntung.

57
00:07:23,943 --> 00:07:26,487
Kalian menjadi pelayan Tuhan.

58
00:07:26,571 --> 00:07:29,449
Kakakmu yang membuatmu datang ke sini?

59
00:07:30,658 --> 00:07:33,327
Ini hukumanku dari ayahku

60
00:07:33,411 --> 00:07:36,456
saat dia tahu
aku dan pacarku akan kawin lari.

61
00:07:56,893 --> 00:07:58,644
Itu dilarang!

62
00:07:58,728 --> 00:08:01,481
Sembunyikan! Kita bisa dimarahi.

63
00:08:03,608 --> 00:08:05,234
Maaf.

64
00:08:05,318 --> 00:08:09,071
Tapi tiap kali aku sedih atau takut,

65
00:08:09,155 --> 00:08:10,573
aku jadi lapar.

66
00:08:10,656 --> 00:08:11,657
Ya Tuhan!

67
00:08:13,075 --> 00:08:16,746
Kalian tahu hukuman orang
yang berdosa lewat ucapannya?

68
00:08:18,539 --> 00:08:22,001
Tak bisa bicara lagi seumur hidup.

69
00:08:23,794 --> 00:08:26,506
Dengarkan aku!

70
00:08:26,589 --> 00:08:28,716
Iblis telah datang!

71
00:09:21,227 --> 00:09:23,771
Tuhan, aku takkan mengambil
yang bukan punyaku.

72
00:09:23,854 --> 00:09:25,648
Aku hanya akan melihat.

73
00:11:24,183 --> 00:11:27,353
Aku yakin itu suara Clara.

74
00:11:27,436 --> 00:11:28,896
Ada yang tidak beres.

75
00:11:28,979 --> 00:11:31,899
Kakak Clara sudah lama
tidak menulis surat kepadaku.

76
00:11:31,982 --> 00:11:33,984
Apa pun yang terjadi kepadanya,

77
00:11:34,068 --> 00:11:35,778
ini mungkin penyebabnya.

78
00:11:35,861 --> 00:11:39,407
Suster-Suster, bisakah kalian menemaniku
mencari kakakku?

79
00:11:51,627 --> 00:11:53,546
Aku tak bisa memaksa kalian.

80
00:11:53,629 --> 00:11:55,798
Suster, tunggu!

81
00:11:57,758 --> 00:11:59,718
Waktunya makan malam.

82
00:12:09,019 --> 00:12:10,563
Terakhir,

83
00:12:11,439 --> 00:12:13,774
tetaplah kuat dalam perjuanganmu

84
00:12:13,858 --> 00:12:17,820
agar sanggup melawan
segala tipu daya iblis

85
00:12:19,238 --> 00:12:22,283
sebab musuh kita bukan sesama manusia.

86
00:12:22,366 --> 00:12:24,493
Di mana Suster Piedad?

87
00:12:24,577 --> 00:12:27,830
- Aku tak melihatnya setelah ibadat sore.
- Tapi melawan kekuatan…

88
00:12:28,456 --> 00:12:33,586
Penguasa kegelapan yang ada di dunia ini.

89
00:13:04,366 --> 00:13:05,242
Clara!

90
00:13:07,536 --> 00:13:09,163
Clara!

91
00:13:10,664 --> 00:13:12,917
Clara, kau kenapa? Kenapa kau begini?

92
00:13:13,000 --> 00:13:15,461
- Apa yang mereka lakukan?
- Suster Flor.

93
00:13:15,544 --> 00:13:19,173
Tubuh terbelenggu, tapi tidak jiwanya.

94
00:13:20,341 --> 00:13:21,592
Siapa?

95
00:13:21,675 --> 00:13:22,885
Siapa, Clara?

96
00:13:23,761 --> 00:13:26,013
Ada bayangan…

97
00:13:26,096 --> 00:13:27,640
berbisik.

98
00:13:27,723 --> 00:13:30,142
- Kaul keheningan!
- Mereka mempermainkan kita.

99
00:13:30,226 --> 00:13:33,437
Clara, apa? Apa maksudmu?

100
00:13:34,021 --> 00:13:36,607
Kau mengganggu ketenangan makan malam!

101
00:13:36,690 --> 00:13:37,858
Kembali ke dalam!

102
00:13:39,151 --> 00:13:41,153
Apa yang kau lakukan kepada kakakku?

103
00:13:41,904 --> 00:13:43,280
Biadab sekali!

104
00:13:43,364 --> 00:13:45,449
Apa mereka melukaimu?

105
00:13:45,533 --> 00:13:47,034
Apa yang mereka lakukan?

106
00:13:47,117 --> 00:13:49,537
Mereka memaksamu minum apa? Racun?

107
00:13:49,620 --> 00:13:50,996
Jangan makan malam ini!

108
00:13:51,080 --> 00:13:53,207
- Clara!
- Jangan makan malam ini!

109
00:13:53,290 --> 00:13:56,418
Tunggu, aku hanya ingin bicara
dengan kakakku! Clara!

110
00:13:56,502 --> 00:13:57,753
Clara!

111
00:14:04,218 --> 00:14:06,595
Suster Piedad masih hilang.

112
00:14:06,679 --> 00:14:07,888
Di mana dia?

113
00:14:07,972 --> 00:14:11,725
Mungkin dia ada di kapel
atau di ruang sembahyang.

114
00:14:41,797 --> 00:14:44,675
Apa kegelapan membuatmu takut, Suster?

115
00:14:46,510 --> 00:14:50,389
Kau seharusnya lebih takut
terhadap hukuman yang menantimu.

116
00:14:56,186 --> 00:14:59,857
Apa yang kau lakukan kepada kakakku?
Keluarkan aku!

117
00:14:59,940 --> 00:15:02,776
Keluarkan aku dari sini!

118
00:15:05,487 --> 00:15:07,406
Clara!

119
00:15:07,489 --> 00:15:09,241
Kau harus jera.

120
00:15:09,325 --> 00:15:12,870
Mematuhi perintah
adalah jalan menuju kekudusan.

121
00:15:30,888 --> 00:15:33,849
Clara, bagaimana denganku saat kau pergi?

122
00:15:36,602 --> 00:15:38,771
Siapa yang akan jadi kekuatanku?

123
00:15:40,105 --> 00:15:43,359
Kau tak butuh aku
untuk menjadi kuat, Flor.

124
00:15:44,234 --> 00:15:45,945
Kau berani.

125
00:15:46,528 --> 00:15:49,365
Kekuatanmu ada di dalam dirimu.

126
00:15:50,532 --> 00:15:54,078
Kelak kau akan menjadi
kekuatan orang lain.

127
00:16:02,920 --> 00:16:04,880
<i>Flor.</i>

128
00:16:04,964 --> 00:16:06,757
<i>Flor.</i>

129
00:16:46,505 --> 00:16:48,382
Bawa seseorang denganmu.

130
00:16:48,465 --> 00:16:50,009
Kubur dia di belakang.

131
00:16:50,092 --> 00:16:52,720
Ini mungkin maksud Suster Clara.

132
00:16:52,803 --> 00:16:55,681
- Iblis ada di sini!
- Diam!

133
00:16:57,182 --> 00:16:59,601
Tak boleh ada yang tahu tentang ini.

134
00:17:00,644 --> 00:17:02,187
Tapi, Suster Juana?

135
00:17:02,271 --> 00:17:05,274
Penglihatan Clara menyebabkan ini.

136
00:17:05,357 --> 00:17:08,527
Iblis menggunakan dia untuk menakuti kita.

137
00:17:08,610 --> 00:17:11,196
Tapi kita takkan kalah.

138
00:17:11,280 --> 00:17:13,490
Kita harus berdoa lebih keras.

139
00:17:14,283 --> 00:17:16,869
Ya, Kepala Biara.

140
00:17:16,952 --> 00:17:20,164
Cari bantuan untuk mengubur
Suster Piedad sebelum fajar.

141
00:17:20,247 --> 00:17:22,124
- Cepat!
- Ya, Suster Juana.

142
00:17:46,398 --> 00:17:47,858
<i>Juana.</i>

143
00:18:19,681 --> 00:18:26,063
Kemarilah. Buka ini.

144
00:18:26,146 --> 00:18:28,148
Ya Tuhan.

145
00:19:16,738 --> 00:19:19,575
Kapal hilang saudaramu telah ditemukan.

146
00:19:19,658 --> 00:19:21,910
Sudah berlabuh, dia masih hidup.

147
00:19:21,994 --> 00:19:23,954
Terima kasih banyak, Suster Clara.

148
00:19:24,037 --> 00:19:26,373
Terima kasih banyak.

149
00:19:30,335 --> 00:19:32,546
Suster Clara, badanku sakit.

150
00:20:10,792 --> 00:20:12,419
Kalian dengar itu?

151
00:20:12,502 --> 00:20:15,005
Kurasa ada yang mengikuti kita.

152
00:20:15,797 --> 00:20:17,341
Jangan membicarakannya.

153
00:20:17,424 --> 00:20:19,927
Jika dibicarakan, itu akan menjadi nyata.

154
00:20:21,553 --> 00:20:24,139
Lakukan sesukamu.
Aku tak mau cari masalah.

155
00:20:25,182 --> 00:20:26,350
Salve!

156
00:20:31,230 --> 00:20:33,106
Apa itu?

157
00:20:38,779 --> 00:20:40,280
Siapa yang memecahkannya?

158
00:20:42,741 --> 00:20:44,201
Bukan aku.

159
00:20:53,919 --> 00:20:57,339
Kau lagi, Suster Ana?

160
00:20:59,675 --> 00:21:01,343
Bukan aku.

161
00:21:01,885 --> 00:21:03,387
Bersihkan.

162
00:21:03,470 --> 00:21:05,097
Bersihkan!

163
00:21:05,180 --> 00:21:06,932
Gunakan mulutmu.

164
00:21:08,892 --> 00:21:10,227
Apa?

165
00:21:14,231 --> 00:21:16,566
Apa katamu?

166
00:21:16,650 --> 00:21:19,444
Jangan membuatku mengulanginya.

167
00:21:19,528 --> 00:21:22,281
Ini tak adil!

168
00:21:23,323 --> 00:21:26,910
Tahu apa kau soal keadilan, Suster Flor?

169
00:21:30,622 --> 00:21:34,418
Kalian datang ke sini untuk dibina,

170
00:21:34,501 --> 00:21:36,753
bukan untuk bertanya.

171
00:21:55,939 --> 00:21:57,607
Aku akan melakukannya.

172
00:21:58,984 --> 00:22:00,569
Aku akan melakukannya.

173
00:22:02,029 --> 00:22:04,614
Aku akan melakukannya.

174
00:22:19,504 --> 00:22:22,090
Apa yang kau sembunyikan dari kami?

175
00:22:52,079 --> 00:22:55,540
Aku membawa sesuatu
untuk menghilangkan bau tanah.

176
00:23:00,962 --> 00:23:03,799
Aku hanya merayakan kehidupan
yang diberikan kepadaku.

177
00:23:05,592 --> 00:23:07,094
Apa ini hari ulang tahunmu?

178
00:23:07,177 --> 00:23:08,470
Ya.

179
00:23:10,222 --> 00:23:12,474
Boleh minta?

180
00:23:22,567 --> 00:23:24,027
Suster Flor?

181
00:23:28,031 --> 00:23:30,659
Tidak, terima kasih.

182
00:23:31,243 --> 00:23:34,579
Semoga kau menemukan cara
untuk meninggalkan tempat ini

183
00:23:36,039 --> 00:23:39,417
dan menjalani hidup yang kau impikan.

184
00:23:46,383 --> 00:23:49,302
Aku tahu Clara takkan meninggalkanku.

185
00:23:49,928 --> 00:23:51,888
Aku harus menemukan dia.

186
00:24:16,705 --> 00:24:17,831
Suster!

187
00:24:19,166 --> 00:24:20,417
Suster Flor!

188
00:24:20,500 --> 00:24:21,918
Suster Salve!

189
00:24:22,002 --> 00:24:23,587
Kemarilah dan lihat ini!

190
00:24:39,603 --> 00:24:40,979
SUSTER IGNACIA

191
00:24:52,407 --> 00:24:54,993
Mereka meninggal berturut-turut.

192
00:24:59,748 --> 00:25:02,042
Ada yang baru dikubur.

193
00:25:18,391 --> 00:25:20,435
Mereka di sini, Kepala Biara!

194
00:25:49,631 --> 00:25:52,926
Kalian tak hanya mencuri dari dapur,

195
00:25:53,009 --> 00:25:54,970
tapi juga melanggar aturan

196
00:25:55,053 --> 00:25:58,932
untuk tidak pergi ke belakang biara.

197
00:26:12,320 --> 00:26:13,989
Awasi mereka.

198
00:26:14,698 --> 00:26:16,700
Ini yang akan menyelamatkanmu.

199
00:26:17,784 --> 00:26:21,955
Ini akan mengingatkanmu
untuk tak berbuat dosa.

200
00:26:23,623 --> 00:26:26,584
Ini akan menyucikan jiwamu.

201
00:26:52,485 --> 00:26:56,031
Tuhan, tolong singkirkan

202
00:26:57,407 --> 00:27:00,076
segala yang menggelisahkan jiwaku.

203
00:27:01,453 --> 00:27:03,872
Mereka telah berdosa.

204
00:27:04,497 --> 00:27:06,624
Mereka pantas dihukum.

205
00:27:07,208 --> 00:27:09,627
Bukan aku yang jahat.

206
00:27:57,384 --> 00:28:01,596
Inikah balasanku, Ya Tuhan?

207
00:28:35,630 --> 00:28:36,840
Ibu.

208
00:29:44,741 --> 00:29:47,160
Gerhana akan menelan bulan.

209
00:29:47,243 --> 00:29:49,871
Tapi iblis akan melahap gerhana.

210
00:29:50,789 --> 00:29:53,708
Lalu, dia akan menguasai dunia.

211
00:30:07,722 --> 00:30:10,350
Ke mana mereka membawa jasad Rita?

212
00:30:14,604 --> 00:30:17,357
Mungkin sudah dikembalikan
kepada keluarganya.

213
00:30:22,320 --> 00:30:24,823
Apa dia bunuh diri gara-gara kita?

214
00:30:26,991 --> 00:30:28,535
Dia lemah.

215
00:30:30,578 --> 00:30:32,747
Dia merasa bersalah karena kita dihukum

216
00:30:32,831 --> 00:30:34,791
gara-gara laporan dia.

217
00:30:49,848 --> 00:30:51,724
Apa itu?

218
00:31:02,777 --> 00:31:03,945
Ayo pergi dari sini!

219
00:31:11,244 --> 00:31:14,581
Tunggu! Nanti aku menyusul.
Aku harus mencari kakakku.

220
00:31:14,664 --> 00:31:16,124
Suster Flor!

221
00:31:16,708 --> 00:31:18,084
Ikut aku!

222
00:31:20,420 --> 00:31:21,880
Suster Salve?

223
00:31:23,339 --> 00:31:24,674
Di mana kau?

224
00:31:25,967 --> 00:31:28,553
Salve, jangan tinggalkan aku!

225
00:31:31,931 --> 00:31:33,433
Ana?

226
00:31:35,059 --> 00:31:36,686
Ana?

227
00:31:36,769 --> 00:31:39,439
Jangan tinggalkan aku di sini, Salve!

228
00:31:41,441 --> 00:31:42,984
Ya Tuhan!

229
00:31:43,067 --> 00:31:45,236
Masuk! Kembali ke kamar kalian!

230
00:31:45,320 --> 00:31:48,239
Kunci pintunya
dan diam di dalam apa pun yang terjadi!

231
00:31:48,323 --> 00:31:50,366
Cepat! Ke sana!

232
00:32:04,088 --> 00:32:05,256
Clara, di mana kau?

233
00:32:07,175 --> 00:32:08,927
Kau takkan selamat!

234
00:32:09,010 --> 00:32:10,386
Aku tak takut, Rita!

235
00:32:10,470 --> 00:32:12,347
Tak ada jalan keluar!

236
00:32:12,430 --> 00:32:13,473
Kau takkan selamat!

237
00:32:21,147 --> 00:32:23,983
Salve, jangan tinggalkan aku!

238
00:32:26,653 --> 00:32:28,071
Salve!

239
00:34:28,066 --> 00:34:29,609
Clara?

240
00:34:35,656 --> 00:34:37,075
Clara?

241
00:34:49,670 --> 00:34:50,755
Iblis…

242
00:34:50,838 --> 00:34:52,882
Iblis!

243
00:34:52,965 --> 00:34:55,259
Iblis!

244
00:34:55,343 --> 00:34:57,178
Clara! Clara, ini aku, Flor!

245
00:35:01,474 --> 00:35:04,435
Salam Maria, penuh rahmat, Tuhan sertamu.

246
00:35:04,519 --> 00:35:06,896
